# Wallet module — Phase 0 architecture contract

**Phase:** 0 (foundational preparation)  
**Runtime status:** Pure `packages/wallet-core` domain + tenant-scoped Prisma persistence (Phase 2C) + guarded generic HTTP contracts/handlers (Phase 2D) + workspace-agnostic member portal read UI (Phase 3A) + operator wallet ops UI (Phase 3B). No gateway top-up, withdrawals, or Denali activation.
**Authority:** [ADR-WALLET-001](./adr/ADR-WALLET-001-member-wallet-bounded-context.mdoc)

---

## 1. Existing “wallet” name collision impact report

### 1.1 Registration finance / synthetic ledger (not Member Wallet)

| Symbol / pattern                                                | Location                                                                            | Meaning                                                             | Member Wallet conflict                                                  |
| --------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `bookingWalletId(registrationId)`                               | `packages/workspaces/denali/src/finance/ledger-accounts.ts`                         | GL credit account `booking:{registrationId}`                        | **High** — name implies member wallet; actually registration sub-ledger |
| `financeWs2BookingWalletId` … `financeWs6BookingWalletId`       | `packages/workspaces/finance-ws*/src/finance/chart-of-accounts.ts`                  | Prefixed `wsN:booking:{registrationId}` accounts                    | **High** — same semantics, certification workspaces                     |
| `LEDGER_ACCOUNTS` / `FINANCE_WS*_LEDGER_ACCOUNTS`               | Denali + finance-ws chart-of-accounts                                               | Operator clearing, discount contra GL codes                         | **Low** — no “wallet” in export name except comments                    |
| `walletNetMinor`                                                | `packages/finance-core/src/domain/compile-invoice-balances.ts`, web finance/tour UI | Invoice field: prepayment + paid − refunds for one registration     | **High** — reads like member balance; is derived read model only        |
| `finance.ledger.capture`, `finance.ledger.double_entry_applied` | Outbox / `prisma-finance.repository.ts`                                             | Registration payment journal events                                 | **Medium** — “ledger” overlap; different aggregate                      |
| ADR-010 “booking wallet credit”                                 | `docs/phase-20/p7/appendices/adr/ADR-010-*.md`                                      | XOR between TourCreated and payment capture on registration account | **Medium** — terminology only; finance scoped                           |

**Phase 0 action:** Document only. No renames (production strings, tests, and finance golden guards depend on current names).

